\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Annotated learner substitutions in L2-ARCTIC and the verdict of the pipeline evaluated in this section. Top: /s/ said as /\textesh / and the reverse (the last panel is a miss: the tool hears /\textesh / and gives \textit  {almost}); bottom: /p/ said as /b/ and the reverse. In the first bottom panel the VOT is long (115~ms) although the annotators heard /b/, which is why a VOT rule alone fails.}}{9}{}\protected@file@percent }
