\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Why native-voice rules fail for learners. Left: CoG of word-initial /s/ and /\textesh / in native ARCTIC voices and in correctly produced L2 speech; the L2 /s/ extends below the fixed 4{,}340~Hz threshold. Right: VOT of /p/ and /b/ in native and correctly produced L2 speech; the 30~ms threshold separates the learners' categories less well.}}{9}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:shift}{{8}{9}{}{figure.8}{}}
